<view class="merchant-page merchant-income-page">
  <view class="merchant-header">
    <view class="merchant-title">收益</view>
    <view class="merchant-subtitle">查看内部模拟收益口径</view>
  </view>

  <view class="merchant-section-card merchant-income-notice">
    <view class="merchant-section-title">内部模拟流水</view>
    <view class="merchant-section-note">
      商家收益当前复用服务方收益展示口径，不支持真实提现、分账或自动结算。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="merchant-kpi-grid">
    <view
      wx:for="{{summaryItems}}"
      wx:key="label"
      class="merchant-kpi-card"
    >
      <view class="merchant-kpi-label">{{ item.label }}</view>
      <view class="merchant-kpi-value">{{ item.value }}</view>
      <view class="merchant-kpi-desc">{{ item.desc }}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="merchant-section-card">
    <view class="merchant-section-title">财务边界</view>
    <view class="merchant-section-note">
      当前没有真实清算、真实分账、真实提现或真实资金流水；如需进入真实资金阶段，必须另起高风险阶段。
    </view>
  </view>

  <merchant-tab-bar active="income"></merchant-tab-bar>
</view>
